TIPS FOR AI:

1. Read ALL files before generating (don't skip any)
2. Prioritize 02-constraints.json for exact values
3. Use 04-style-guide.md for every sentence
4. Liquid prose = complex sentences, NOT short staccato
5. Sensory weaving = weave into narrative, NOT "Smell: X"
6. NO lists, NO parentheses, NO named emotions
7. Russian literary vocabulary
8. Be honest in compliance report (mark FAIL if constraint missed)

